    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hero System:</strong><br>Choose from different heroes, each with unique skills and playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pinball Types:</strong><br>Pinballs come with various attributes and even special effects. Different pinballs have different effects on different monsters\u2014use their traits wisely to win with ease.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monster System:</strong><br>Monsters vary not only in shape and attributes but also include special ones with unique abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Synthesis &amp; Drop System:</strong><br>Combine two pinballs to create a higher-level pinball with even more powerful effects.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hero System:</strong><br>Choose from different heroes, each with unique skills and playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pinball Types:</strong><br>Pinballs come with various attributes and even special effects. Different pinballs have different effects on different monsters\u2014use their traits wisely to win with ease.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monster System:</strong><br>Monsters vary not only in shape and attributes but also include special ones with unique abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Synthesis &amp; Drop System:</strong><br>Combine two pinballs to create a higher-level pinball with even more powerful effects.</p>",
